 for your pull request. All authors of the commits have signed the CLA. :+1: ","created_at":"2026-01-15T14:47:58+08:00","updated_at":"2026-01-15T14:47:58+08:00","user":{"id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","login":"cann-robot","object_id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","name":"CANN-robot","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/bf/ad/b7f29486a040d7b2f52bf6c78414692d7d585eb1ec628cea3eb01c9d63f68618.png?time=1755691472703","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/cann-robot"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":160077332,"discussion_id":"da302eeb2b505bf73f8eca5d59fce5e040c7d4ea","body":":large_blue_circle: source code change are detected, tasks labels is removed in this pull request!","created_at":"2026-01-15T14:48:00+08:00","updated_at":"2026-01-15T14:48:00+08:00","user":{"id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","login":"cann-robot","object_id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","name":"CANN-robot","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/bf/ad/b7f29486a040d7b2f52bf6c78414692d7d585eb1ec628cea3eb01c9d63f68618.png?time=1755691472703","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/cann-robot"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":160077546,"discussion_id":"d2d38f4f95cf338a5ed7c77946a7057d02f1e45b","body":"### 代码可读性与维护性: 新增的常量 FLAG_BUFF_SIZE 值为 1024U，但在代码中多处使用硬编码的 1024 作为数组索引或偏移量。虽然新增常量提高了代码的可读性，但并未替换所有相关的硬编码值，导致代码中存在不一致性。例如，在 SumToWindow 函数中，shareFlagGlobal_ 的索引计算使用了 (serverId_ + 1) * FLAG_BUFF_SIZE + tokenOffset，这比原来的 (serverId_ + 1) * 1024 + tokenOffset * 4 更清晰。然而，需要检查代码中是否还有其他地方使用了硬编码的 1024 或 4，以确保完全替换。\n\n**问题类型**: 代码可读性与维护性\n**文件路径**: `mc2/moe_distribute_combine/op_kernel/moe_distribute_combine_a2_layered.h`\n**行号**: 66\n**问题代码**:\n```unknown\nconstexpr static uint32_t FLAG_BUFF_SIZE = 1024U;\n```\n**修改建议**:\n```\n1. 确保在整个代码文件中，所有与标志缓冲区大小相关的硬编码值（如 1024 和 4）都已替换为 FLAG_BUFF_SIZE 和适当的 sizeof 计算。2. 如果 FLAG_BUFF_SIZE 表示的是元素个数（例如 uint64_t 的个数），那么在 DataCopy 或 DataCopyPad 调用中，拷贝的长度参数应基于 FLAG_BUFF_SIZE * sizeof(element_type) 或类似计算，而不是硬编码的 4（假设 4 表示 4 * sizeof(uint64_t) = 32 字节）。3. 建议添加注释说明 FLAG_BUFF_SIZE 的单位（例如，是 uint64_t 元素的个数）。\n```\n\n---\n*此评论由代码审查工具自动生成*","created_at":"2026-01-15T14:48:46+08:00","updated_at":"2026-01-23T09:36:52+08:00","user":{"id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","login":"cann-robot","object_id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","name":"CANN-robot","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/bf/ad/b7f29486a040d7b2f52bf6c78414692d7d585eb1ec628cea3eb01c9d63f68618.png?time=1755691472703","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/cann-robot"},"comment_type":"diff_comment","resolved":true,"resolved_by":{"id":"687eec89d34610402c582825","login":"liuboxi","object_id":"687eec89d34610402c582825","name":"liuboxi","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/liuboxi"},"diff_position":{"start_new_line":66,"end_new_line":66,"position_type":"text"}},{"id":160077810,"discussion_id":"af65f1afa5cf0b116c1f32c7a804a173f67e4d15","body":"## 问题/功能描述\n\n本次PR对MoE（Mixture of Experts）分布式计算内核进行了两项关键优化。首先，解决了在多轮次执行场景下，因标志位值固定不变可能导致不同轮次间状态混淆和错误匹配的问题，以确保分布式通信和数据分发的正确性与隔离性。其次，对标志位缓冲区大小和拷贝逻辑进行了重构，以提升代码的可维护性，并确保跨服务器RDMA通信时数据拷贝的准确性和一致性。\n\n## 修改方案描述\n\n修改方案主要包括两点核心内容。一是引入动态标志位机制，通过在原有的固定常量上叠加一个动态生成的唯一值，为每个执行轮次生成不同的标志位，从而有效避免了跨轮次的状态污染。二是引入常量定义以替换硬编码的缓冲区大小，并将多处直接的数据拷贝逻辑统一替换为具有边界对齐和格式检查功能的拷贝函数，增强了代码的健壮性和可维护性。","created_at":"2026-01-15T14:49:33+08:00","updated_at":"2026-01-15T14:49:33+08:00","user":{"id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","login":"cann-robot","object_id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","name":"CANN-robot","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/bf/ad/b7f29486a040d7b2f52bf6c78414692d7d585eb1ec628cea3eb01c9d63f68618.png?time=1755691472703","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/cann-robot"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":160078005,"discussion_id":"04eabf74666e425c45e0fe195a7d854c69be1c78","body":"compile","created_at":"2026-01-15T14:50:21+08:00","updated_at":"2026-01-15T14:50:21+08:00","user":{"id":"6704f6ecbaec536c76204d48","login":"urbub","object_id":"6704f6ecbaec536c76204d48","name":"linhailong3","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/bd/cc/201b00d0424c20c6a24396bad0e1d03020df125da620e1dad48a6e86806bf9f5.jpg","html_url":"https://